      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "• Remove the cord from the working speaker and connect it to the “faulty” speaker. - If the speaker now works, the problem was in the original speaker cord. - If there is still no sound, the problem is in the speaker. • If trouble persists, contact your authorized Bose ® dealer, who will arrange for service. Or,",
