      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Testing the connections\nTo make sure your speakers operate correctly, follow these steps:\n1. Set the balance control on your receiver or amplifier to normal (centered).\n2. Play some deep bass passages of music through the speakers.\nThe sound should seem to come from a point between the two speakers. The bass should be full and natural. If not, your connections may be reversed, causing the speakers to play out of phase.",
